2a\">To opt out or change where you receive security notifications, <a id=\"iLink2\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://account.live.com/SecurityNotifications/Update\" style=\"color:#2672ec; text-decoration:none\">click here</a>.</td></tr><tr><td id=\"i7\" style=\"padding:0; padding-top:25px; font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#2a2a2a\">Thanks,</td></tr><tr><td id=\"i8\" style=\"padding:0; font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#2a2a2a\">The Microsoft account team</td></tr></tbody></table><div lang=\"en\" style=\"margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:10px\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=521839\">Privacy Statement</a><div style=\"margin-top:10px\">Microsoft Corporation, One Microsoft Way, Redmond, WA 98052</div></div></body></html>"
